<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>IPEDS Data Center</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .text-right {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  th, td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
  th { font-weight: bold; }
  .header { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .sub-header { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .data-table td:nth-child(2), .data-table td:nth-child(3), .data-table td:nth-child(4) { text-align: right; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">National Center for Education Statistics</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">IPEDS Data Center</h2>
  <p><strong>University of Florida</strong></p>
  <p>UnitID: <span data-field="unit_id">{{ unit_id }}</span></p>
  <p>OPEID: <span data-field="opeid">{{ opeid }}</span></p>
  <p>Address: <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></p>
  <p>Web Address: <span data-field="web_address">{{ web_address }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Finance 2012-013</h2>
  <p>Institution: <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span> (ID: <span data-field="institution_id">{{ institution_id }}</span>)</p>
  <p>Finance - Public Institutions</p>
  <p>Please indicate which reporting standards are used to prepare your financial statements:</p>
  <p>
    <input type="radio" name="reporting_standard" value="GASB" id="gasb">
    <label for="gasb">GASB (Governmental Accounting Standards Board), using standards of GASB 34 & 35</label><br>
    <input type="radio" name="reporting_standard" value="FASB" id="fasb">
    <label for="fasb">FASB (Financial Accounting Standards Board)</label>
  </p>
  <p>Please consult your business officer for the correct response before saving this screen. Your response to this question will determine the forms you will receive for reporting finance data.</p>
  <p>Institution: <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span> (ID: <span data-field="institution_id">{{ institution_id }}</span>)</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Finance - Public Institutions</h3>
  <p>GASB-Reporting Institutions (aligned form)</p>
  <p>To the extent possible, the finance data requested in this report should be provided from your institution's audited General Purpose Financial Statements (GPFS). Please refer to the instructions specific to each screen of the survey for details and references.</p>

  <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 15px;">1. Fiscal Year Calendar</h4>
  <p>This report covers financial activities for the <span data-field="fiscal_year">{{ fiscal_year }}</span>-month fiscal year:</p>
  <p>Beginning: month/year (MM/YYYY) <span data-field="begin_month">{{ begin_month }}</span> / <span data-field="begin_year">{{ begin_year }}</span></p>
  <p>Ending: month/year (MM/YYYY) <span data-field="end_month">{{ end_month }}</span> / <span data-field="end_year">{{ end_year }}</span></p>

  <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 15px;">2. Audit Opinion</h4>
  <p>Did your institution receive an unqualified opinion on its General Purpose Financial Statements from your auditor for the fiscal year noted above? (If your institution is audited only in combination with another entity, answer this question based on the audit of that entity.)</p>
  <p>
    <input type="radio" name="audit_opinion" value="unqualified" id="unqualified">
    <label for="unqualified">Unqualified</label>
    <input type="radio" name="audit_opinion" value="qualified" id="qualified">
    <label for="qualified">Qualified (Explain in box below)</label>
    <input type="radio" name="audit_opinion" value="donotknow" id="donotknow">
    <label for="donotknow">Don't know (Explain in box below)</label>
  </p>

  <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 15px;">3. Reporting Model</h4>
  <p>GASB Statement No. 34 offers three alternative reporting models for special-purpose governments like colleges and universities. Which model is used by your institution?</p>
  <p>
    <input type="radio" name="reporting_model" value="business_type" id="business_type">
    <label for="business_type">Business Type Activities</label>
    <input type="radio" name="reporting_model" value="governmental" id="governmental">
    <label for="governmental">Governmental Activities</label>
    <input type="radio" name="reporting_model" value="business_governmental" id="business_governmental">
    <label for="business_governmental">Governmental Activities with Business-Type Activities</label>
  </p>

  <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 15px;">4. Intercollegiate Athletics</h4>
  <p>If your institution participates in intercollegiate athletics, are the expenses accounted for as auxiliary enterprises or treated as student services?</p>
  <p>
    <input type="radio" name="athletics_accounting" value="auxiliary" id="auxiliary">
    <label for="auxiliary">Auxiliary enterprises</label><br>
    <input type="radio" name="athletics_accounting" value="student_services" id="student_services">
    <label for="student_services">Student services</label><br>
    <input type="radio" name="athletics_accounting" value="none" id="none">
    <label for="none">Does not participate in intercollegiate athletics</label><br>
    <input type="radio" name="athletics_accounting" value="other" id="other">
    <label for="other">Other (specify in box below)</label>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">5. Endowment Assets</h3>
  <p>Does this institution or any of its foundations or other affiliated organizations own endowment assets?</p>
  <p>
    <input type="radio" name="endowment_assets" value="yes" id="yes">
    <label for="yes">Yes (report endowment assets)</label><br>
    <input type="radio" name="endowment_assets" value="no" id="no">
    <label for="no">No</label>
  </p>
  <p>You may use the space below to provide context for the data you've reported above.</p>
  <p>Question 4. Intercollegiate Athletics: Separate Corporation: University Athletic Association</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Part A - Statement of Financial Position</h3>
  <p>Fiscal Year: <span data-field="fiscal_year_a">{{ fiscal_year_a }}</span> - <span data-field="fiscal_year_a_end">{{ fiscal_year_a_end }}</span></p>
  <p>If your institution is a parent institution then the amounts reported in Parts A and D should include ALL of your child institutions.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Line No.</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Description</th>
        <th class="text-right" style="width: 20%;">Current year amount</th>
        <th class="text-right" style="width: 20%;">Prior year amount</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>01</td>
        <td>Total current assets</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_01_current">{{ pa_01_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_01_prior">{{ pa_01_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>31</td>
        <td>Depreciable capital assets, net of depreciation</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_31_current">{{ pa_31_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_31_prior">{{ pa_31_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>04</td>
        <td>Other noncurrent assets</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_04_current">{{ pa_04_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_04_prior">{{ pa_04_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>05</td>
        <td>Total noncurrent assets</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_05_current">{{ pa_05_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_05_prior">{{ pa_05_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>06</td>
        <td>Total assets</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_06_current">{{ pa_06_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_06_prior">{{ pa_06_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>07</td>
        <td>Current liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_07_current">{{ pa_07_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_07_prior">{{ pa_07_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>08</td>
        <td>Other current liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_08_current">{{ pa_08_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_08_prior">{{ pa_08_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>09</td>
        <td>Total current liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_09_current">{{ pa_09_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_09_prior">{{ pa_09_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>10</td>
        <td>Noncurrent liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_10_current">{{ pa_10_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_10_prior">{{ pa_10_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>11</td>
        <td>Other noncurrent liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_11_current">{{ pa_11_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_11_prior">{{ pa_11_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>12</td>
        <td>Total noncurrent liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_12_current">{{ pa_12_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_12_prior">{{ pa_12_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Line No.</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Description</th>
        <th class="text-right" style="width: 20%;">Current year amount</th>
        <th class="text-right" style="width: 20%;">Prior year amount</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>13</td>
        <td>Total liabilities</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_13_current">{{ pa_13_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_13_prior">{{ pa_13_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>14</td>
        <td>Net assets</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_14_current">{{ pa_14_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_14_prior">{{ pa_14_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>15</td>
        <td>Restricted-expendable</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_15_current">{{ pa_15_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_15_prior">{{ pa_15_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>16</td>
        <td>Restricted-nonexpendable</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_16_current">{{ pa_16_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_16_prior">{{ pa_16_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>17</td>
        <td>Unrestricted</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_17_current">{{ pa_17_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_17_prior">{{ pa_17_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>18</td>
        <td>Total net assets</td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_18_current">{{ pa_18_current }}</span></td>
        <td class="text-right"><span data-field="pa_18_prior">{{ pa_18_prior }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>You may use the space below to provide context for the data you've reported above.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Part B - Statement of Financial Position (Page 2)</h3>
  <p>Fiscal Year: <span data-field="fiscal_year_b">{{ fiscal_year_b }}</span> - <span data-field="fiscal_year_b_end">{{ fiscal_year_b_end }}</span></p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Line No.</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Description</th>
        <th class="text-right" style="width: 20%;">Ending balance</th>
        <th class="text-right" style="width: 20%;">Prior year ending balance</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>21</td>
        <td>Land and land improvements</td>
